{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國天團BIGBANG在香港啟德主場館舉行的4場演唱會昨晚圓滿落幕，曾與BIGBANG在音樂盛事《MAMA AWARDS》上碰面的影帝周潤發、梁朝偉以及YG事務所創辦人楊賢碩都有去捧場，去完獲發哥頒大獎的隊長G-Dragon（GD）特別提起</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T03:04:34.167442+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T02:43:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T02:57:54.233747+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T02:57:54.233747+00:00","content_hash":"45359016d8ae1a548dbd73e93d825597a92bbe0ba606d156bb9422e448ffbfba","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}